title: "hbs-state: index guard for stateful hash-based signatures (XMSS/XMSS^MT)"
abstract: "Index guard for stateful hash-based signatures (XMSS/XMSS^MT): a monotonic counter persisted with fsync, detection of storage that does not actually persist, and reconciliation of the state after a restart. Reference implementation of HBS-STATE. Licensing: the code is available under MIT OR Apache-2.0, at the recipient's option; the specification vectors are under CC0-1.0, which the license field cannot express because it assumes an OR relationship over the whole work. The LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE and spec/LICENSE-CC0 files are authoritative."
